# Nord for lf  ->  ~/.config/lf/colors   (true-colour; needs COLORTERM=truecolor, foot sets it)
# Same syntax as LF_COLORS; first match wins (see `lf -doc`, section COLORS). Selection/cursor use
# lf's reverse video, so they follow these colours automatically.

